  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/Br25KL-OShwGlcMedA4xxPAVYHJDjhf3hTTC1fS98Us.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n$A=\\int_{-1}^0\\{(3+x)-(-x+1)\\} d x+\\int_0^1\\{(3-x)-(-x+1)\\} d x+\\int_1^2\\{(3-x)-(-x-1)\\} d x$\n$=\\int_{-1}^0(2+2 x) d x+\\int_0^1 2 d x+\\int_1^2(4-2 x) d x$\n$=\\left[2 x-x^2\\right]_{-1}^0+[2 x]_0^1+\\left[4 x-x^2\\right]_1^2$\n$=0-(-2+1)+(2-0)+(8-4)-(4-1)$\n$=1+2+4-3=4$ sq. units",
